# Citation metadata of GNX-py (Citation File Format 1.2.0, https://citation-file-format.github.io).
# "version" equals the version in pyproject.toml; a DOI or a paper ("preferred-citation") can be added when one
# exists.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GNX-py in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "GNX-py"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
abstract: >-
  GNX-py is a Python library for GNSS data processing: single point positioning (SPP), precise point
  positioning (PPP) with optional ambiguity resolution, signal-in-space (SIS/SISRE) evaluation of broadcast
  and precise orbits and clocks, slant and vertical TEC processing with ionospheric models, and GNSS data
  downloads, for GPS, Galileo and BeiDou.
authors:
  - family-names: "Pierzchała"
    given-names: "Hubert"
repository-code: "https://github.com/HJpierzchala/GNX"
url: "https://github.com/HJpierzchala/GNX"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - GNSS
  - PPP
  - SPP
  - SISRE
  - ionosphere
  - STEC
  - RINEX
